# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# ORDER MATTERS, and the rule is the opposite of Vercel's: Cloudflare
# evaluates STATIC rules before DYNAMIC (splat) ones, and rules placed after
# a splat can silently stop firing. So every one-to-one redirect is listed
# first and the wildcard portal rules go at the very bottom.
#
# Limits: 2,000 static + 100 dynamic. We use ~45 and 4.

