# ------------------------------------------------------- member portal
# Enabled 21 Sept 2026, once members.pinelakecc.com was confirmed serving a
# real login form on a valid certificate. These carry old bookmarked portal
# links to the new host; without them every member link 404s after cutover.
#
# The static /login rule must stay ABOVE the splats, and the splats must stay
# last in the file - Cloudflare evaluates static before dynamic, and rules
# placed after a splat can silently stop firing.
/login                              https://members.pinelakecc.com/web/pages/login  301
/web/*                              https://members.pinelakecc.com/web/:splat       301
/c/*                                https://members.pinelakecc.com/c/:splat         301
/documents/*                        https://members.pinelakecc.com/documents/:splat 301
/o/*                                https://members.pinelakecc.com/o/:splat         301
# DO NOT REMOVE THE PORTAL RULES BELOW. As of 22 Sept 2026 the member portal
# itself still carries 13 links on the old hostname (5 in its navigation menu,
# 1 PDF link on golf-pro-shop1, 7 staff photos on contact-us1). They work only
# because these rules forward them. Northstar was told and the club chose to
# leave them rather than risk another portal change. Details: LAUNCH.md.
#
# Added 22 Sept 2026. /group/pages/* is where every member-facing portal page
# lives (menus, pro shop, tennis, swim team) and it was missing above, so those
# URLs 404ed on the old host while /web, /c, /documents and /o redirected.
# The ClubNow app and old bookmarks may still carry them. The rest are the
# other Liferay path roots. /api/jsonws is Liferay web services and uses 308
# so a POST stays a POST; our own /api/inquiry is handled in worker.js first.
/group/*                            https://members.pinelakecc.com/group/:splat     301
/delegate/*                         https://members.pinelakecc.com/delegate/:splat  301
/image/*                            https://members.pinelakecc.com/image/:splat     301
/combo/*                            https://members.pinelakecc.com/combo/:splat     301
/html/*                             https://members.pinelakecc.com/html/:splat      301
/user/*                             https://members.pinelakecc.com/user/:splat      301
/api/jsonws/*                       https://members.pinelakecc.com/api/jsonws/:splat 308
